        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Houses of Stucco</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        background-color: #e0e0e0;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        padding: 20px;\n        font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .page {\n        background-color: #fff;\n        width: 850px;\n        padding: 50px 60px;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .header {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .header .date {\n        font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .banner {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 24px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n        margin-bottom: 50px;\n        color: #222;\n    }\n    .banner span {\n        margin: 0 10px;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    .title-container {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n    .title-main {\n        font-size: 56px;\n        letter-spacing: 3px;\n        color: #111;\n    }\n    .title-of {\n        font-size: 42px;\n        font-style: italic;\n        font-family: \"Brush Script MT\", \"Lucida Handwriting\", cursive;\n        margin: 0 15px;\n        vertical-align: baseline;\n    }\n    .content-block {\n        margin-left: 28%;\n        margin-right: 0;\n        text-align: justify;\n        font-size: 14.5px;\n        line-height: 1.7;\n        margin-bottom: 60px;\n        color: #333;\n    }\n    .drop-cap {\n        float: left;\n        font-size: 52px;\n        line-height: 40px;\n        padding-top: 6px;\n        padding-right: 8px;\n        color: #111;\n    }\n    .bullet {\n        font-size: 12px;\n        margin: 0 4px;\n    }\n    .footer-title-container {\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .footer-title-top {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: baseline;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    .footer-stucco {\n        font-size: 46px;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .footer-made-with {\n        font-size: 32px;\n        font-style: italic;\n        font-family: \"Brush Script MT\", \"Lucida Handwriting\", cursive;\n        flex-grow: 1;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n    .footer-atlas-white {\n        font-size: 46px;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n        position: relative;\n    }\n    .footer-number {\n        position: absolute;\n        right: 0;\n        top: -10px;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .footer-portland {\n        text-align: right;\n        font-size: 22px;\n        letter-spacing: 7px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    .image-area {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        width: 72%;\n        height: 420px;\n        background-color: #f0f0f0;\n        border: 1px solid #ccc;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        color: #888;\n        font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .image-caption {\n        width: 24%;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        color: #222;\n    }\n    .caption-bullet {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 20px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span>18</span>\n        <span class=\"date\">American Builder, July 1935.</span>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"banner\">\n        PLEASANT <span>&bull;</span> COLORFUL <span>&bull;</span> STURDY <span>&bull;</span> ECONOMICAL\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"title-container\">\n        <span class=\"title-main\">HOUSES</span>\n        <span class=\"title-of\">of</span>\n        <span class=\"title-main\">STUCCO</span>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-block\">\n        <span class=\"drop-cap\">N</span>EW homes are selling. Modernized homes are selling. And homes finished in attractive, eye-inviting stucco are well up in the <i>profitable</i> sales parade. <span class=\"bullet\">&bull;</span> Stucco as it is made and applied under today's specifications (and did you know that much of it is now <i>factory-prepared?</i>) is a finish particularly fitted to home building—both for new construction and for modernizing. <span class=\"bullet\">&bull;</span> First of all, portland cement stucco is a durable, strong finish—actually it is a thin wall of concrete, and is comparably permanent, weatherproof and fire-resistant. <span class=\"bullet\">&bull;</span> Second, stucco is applied in any texture suited to the architectural design—floated to a smooth finish, troweled in various semi-smooth effects, tooled, stippled, spatter-dashed, rough torn, or treated in other pleasing ways. <span class=\"bullet\">&bull;</span> Third, with a finish coat made with <i>white</i> portland cement, <i>any color</i> is available in stucco—from pure white, through pastel tints of cream and salmon and tan and pink, to rich warm yellows and browns and greens and other shades. <span class=\"bullet\">&bull;</span> Durability, texture, color—these are selling points for stucco that help convince your prospects of a home's desirability—and that mean ready turnover and profit to you. Want the details? Write Universal Atlas Cement Co. (<i>United States Steel Corporation Subsidiary</i>), 208 South LaSalle Street, Chicago.\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"footer-title-container\">\n        <div class=\"footer-title-top\">\n            <span class=\"footer-stucco\">STUCCO</span>\n            <span class=\"footer-made-with\">made with</span>\n            <span class=\"footer-atlas-white\">\n                ATLAS WHITE\n                <span class=\"footer-number\">210</span>\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-portland\">\n            PORTLAND CEMENT\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"image-area\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">\n            [Photograph: House with awnings]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"image-caption\">\n            <div class=\"caption-bullet\">&bull;</div>\n            This trim and tidy home has been modernized with an Atlas White portland cement stucco finish in a semi-rough texture.\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
